<< /A 314 0 R /Alt (Fluorescent microscopy images labeled A to D show cells stained with green and red dyes. Image A and C depict elongated cells with prominent red-stained areas. Image B and D show densely arranged cells with more diffuse red and green staining.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 17 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
