<< /A 315 0 R /Alt (Diagram showing a neuron with a focus on the Ranvier's node and paranode. It illustrates the interaction of GM1 and CASPR2 antibodies impacting ion channels and calcium-dependent enzymes. Labels include MAC, Nav1.6, Kv1.1, Kv1.2, C1q, and CASPR2-TAG-1, highlighting the movement of Na+, K+, and Ca2+ ions.) /K 0 /P 8 0 R /Pg 18 0 R /S /Figure /T () >>
